
   <!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Happy Raksha Bandhan, Soumili Didi!</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9a9e 0%, #fecfef 99%, #fecfef 100%);
      margin: 0;
      padding: 20px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }
    .card {
      background-color: white;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
      max-width: 500px;
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
      border: 3px solid #d4af37;
    }
    h1 {
      color: #b80000;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .rakhi-icon {
      font-size: 60px;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }
    p {
      color: #444;
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-size: 1.1em;
    }
    .gift-btn {
      background-color: #d4af37;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 12px 25px;
      font-size: 1em;
      border-radius: 25px;
      cursor: pointer;
      margin-top: 15px;
      transition: transform 0.2s, background-color 0.2s;
    }
    .gift-btn:hover {
      background-color: #b8860b;
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }
    #surprise {
      display: none;
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 15px;
      background-color: #fff0f5;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px dashed #b80000;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="rakhi-icon">🪔 🌸 🧵</div>
    <h1>Happy Raksha Bandhan,<br>Soumili Didi!</h1>
    <p>Thank you for be my didi and i am really very blessed to be your brother.</p>
    
    <button class="gift-btn" onclick="revealSurprise()">THANK YOU DIDI. I'M ALWAYS WITH YOU❤️.</button>

    <div id="surprise">
      <p><strong> my dear didi:</strong><br> you are the best didi.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    function revealSurprise() {
      const surpriseDiv = document.getElementById('surprise');
      if (surpriseDiv.style.display === 'block') {
        surpriseDiv.style.display = 'none';
      } else {
        surpriseDiv.style.display = 'block';
      }
    }
  </script>

</body>
</html>
